00:26:38.180 --> 00:26:42.210
They broke the metabolic
rift that was impoverishing

00:26:42.210 --> 00:26:46.000
both rural areas and
countryside, excuse me

00:26:46.000 --> 00:26:48.090
what rural areas or impoverished

